    "SNIPERCLASSIC_PRIMARY_NAME": "Sagittare",
    "SNIPERCLASSIC_PRIMARY_DESCRIPTION": "Emitte ictum transfigentem pro <style=cIsDamage>430% damni</style>.\nPost emissum, <style=cIsDamage>recarga</style> ut usque ad <style=cIsDamage>1.5x</style> damni additi accipias si tempore apto factum.",
